{"n":104,"verses":[{"v":1,"en":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","bn":"প্রত্যেক পশ্চাতে ও সম্মুখে পরনিন্দাকারীর দুর্ভোগ","w":[["وَيۡلࣱ","Woe","waylun",281],["لِّكُلِّ","to every","likulli",30],["هُمَزَةٖ","slanderer","humazatin",4752],["لُّمَزَةٍ","backbiter","lumazatin",4753]]},{"v":2,"en":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it","bn":"যে অর্থ সঞ্চিত করে ও গণনা করে","w":[["ٱلَّذِي","The one who","alladhī",7],["جَمَعَ","collects","jamaʿa",461],["مَالٗا","wealth","mālan",125],["وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","and counts it","waʿaddadahu",4754]]},{"v":3,"en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal","bn":"সে মনে করে যে, তার অর্থ চিরকাল তার সাথে থাকবে","w":[["يَحۡسَبُ","Thinking","yaḥsabu",256],["أَنَّ","that","anna",29],["مَالَهُۥٓ","his wealth","mālahu",125],["أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","will make him immortal","akhladahu",2342]]},{"v":4,"en":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher","bn":"কখনও না, সে অবশ্যই নিক্ষিপ্ত হবে পিষ্টকারীর মধ্যে।","w":[["كَلَّاۖ","Nay","kallā",338],["لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","Surely he will be thrown","layunbadhanna",811],["فِي","in","fī",3],["ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","the Crusher","l-ḥuṭamati",2816]]},{"v":5,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher","bn":"আপনি কি জানেন, পিষ্টকারী কি","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā",2],["أَدۡرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka",571],["مَا","what","mā",2],["ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","the Crusher (is)","l-ḥuṭamatu",2816]]},{"v":6,"en":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled","bn":"এটা আল্লাহর প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি","w":[["نَارُ","A Fire","nāru",80],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",1],["ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","kindled","l-mūqadatu",4755]]},{"v":7,"en":"Which mounts directed at the hearts","bn":"যা হৃদয় পর্যন্ত পৌছবে।","w":[["ٱلَّتِي","Which","allatī",7],["تَطَّلِعُ","mounts up","taṭṭaliʿu",1073],["عَلَى","to","ʿalā",8],["ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","the hearts","l-afidati",596]]},{"v":8,"en":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them","bn":"এতে তাদেরকে বেঁধে দেয়া হবে","w":[["إِنَّهَا","Indeed, it","innahā",5],["عَلَيۡهِم","(will be) upon them","ʿalayhim",8],["مُّؤۡصَدَةࣱ","closed over","mu'ṣadatun",2813]]},{"v":9,"en":"In extended columns","bn":"লম্বা লম্বা খুঁটিতে।","w":[["فِي","In","fī",3],["عَمَدٖ","columns","ʿamadin",1958],["مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","extended","mumaddadatin",4756]]}]}